id: SHELL31-1
package: fandhe-workshop-web
test: shell_notice_sample
target: crates/web/src/shell.rs
find:     let kind = attr(attrs, NOTICE_KIND_ATTR).and_then(NoticeKind::parse);
replace:     let kind = attr(attrs, NOTICE_KIND_ATTR).and_then(NoticeKind::parse).or(Some(NoticeKind::SaveFailed));
expect-fail: 未定義の通知の種類は失敗する
note: 検査器が未定義の通知の種類を違反にしない（SHELL-31・TASK-511）
